You'll pay, Yami.

245
00:14:54,620 --> 00:14:59,800
You may have defeated Sleightheart,
but I hold another Egyptian god card,

246
00:15:00,040 --> 00:15:02,140
a much more powerful one.

247
00:15:04,500 --> 00:15:09,640
So savor this victory while you
can, for it will be your last.

248
00:15:12,920 --> 00:15:14,280
Yugi won the duel.

249
00:15:14,540 --> 00:15:16,422
What a totally awesome comeback.

250
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:20,180
Hand over your Egyptian god card to Yugi.

251
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:21,360
Tournament rules.

252
00:15:21,540 --> 00:15:23,280
Come on, snap out of it.

253
00:15:23,920 --> 00:15:27,480
I mean, no one likes to lose,
but rules are rules, you know?

254
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:30,237
Hey, don't be so hard on yourself, mister.

255
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:31,340
It's just a game.

256
00:15:32,540 --> 00:15:33,840
Oh, there it is.

257
00:15:34,700 --> 00:15:36,876
His life of the Sky Dragon's awesome.

258
00:15:37,540 --> 00:15:39,800
I wish Seto and I could keep it.

259
00:15:40,480 --> 00:15:43,077
But as commissioner of the
Battle City Tournament,

260
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:46,807
I have to hand this card over
to you, Yugi, and you earned it.

261
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:49,660
And that's not all.

262
00:15:50,680 --> 00:15:52,820
You get his locator card also.

263
00:15:54,760 --> 00:15:59,197
Just don't get too attached, because my
brother's got his eye on that dragon, too.

264
00:15:59,280 --> 00:16:00,180
So watch out.

265
00:16:00,340 --> 00:16:02,140
I must be careful with this.

266
00:16:04,300 --> 00:16:08,220
Yugi, so you figured out how to
defeat Slifer the Sky Dragon.

267
00:16:08,820 --> 00:16:09,720
Well done.

268
00:16:10,040 --> 00:16:12,922
It's a real shame you
won't have it for too long.

269
00:16:13,240 --> 00:16:14,220
Why not?

270
00:16:14,440 --> 00:16:17,880
Because you and I are going
to duel for it right now.

271
00:16:18,460 --> 00:16:23,100
Then, when I defeat you, Slifer the
Sky Dragon will be where it belongs.

272
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:24,540
In my deck.

273
00:16:25,100 --> 00:16:25,930
You see,

274
00:16:26,013 --> 00:16:30,446
I'm already in possession of one Egyptian
god card and I plan to win the others.

275
00:16:31,080 --> 00:16:32,820
Now it's time to duel.

276
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:36,400
Once I win Slifer from you,
I'll only need one more.

277
00:16:36,640 --> 00:16:39,522
Then I'll be the number
one duelist in the world.

278
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:44,980
Silly fools!

279
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:46,670
Hmm.

280
00:16:46,753 --> 00:16:49,097
I've had enough of your
mind tricks, Merrick!

281
00:16:49,180 --> 00:16:51,400
It's time for you to show yourself!

282
00:16:52,620 --> 00:16:54,260
Not to worry, Pharaoh.

283
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:56,656
You'll meet me sooner than you think.

284
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:59,720
I'm on my way to Battle City as we speak.

285
00:17:00,420 --> 00:17:03,302
Once I'm there, the next
phase of my plan begins.

286
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:06,457
I assure you the power of
the Pharaoh will be mine!

287
00:17:06,540 --> 00:17:11,120
My loyal mind servants are
preparing for my arrival right now!

288
00:17:11,480 --> 00:17:12,977
Where are they, Merrick?

289
00:17:13,060 --> 00:17:16,240
I have rare hunters
everywhere in Battle City.

290
00:17:18,040 --> 00:17:19,780
And I can see all.

291
00:17:20,060 --> 00:17:22,597
I see the Millennium
Puzzle that will be mine.

292
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:25,660
I see a defenseless city
waiting to be conquered.

293
00:17:26,040 --> 00:17:29,360
And I see potential mine
slaves in every crowd.

294
00:17:29,620 --> 00:17:34,160
I'm always searching for new servants
to add to my army of rare hunters.

295
00:17:34,520 --> 00:17:36,140
I wonder who'll be next.

296
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:39,617
Aw, man, I was this close to
kicking Kaiba's butt in a duel.

297
00:17:39,700 --> 00:17:44,520
So why did you look so relieved when
he had to suddenly take off? What?

298
00:17:44,680 --> 00:17:47,100
I'm not afraid of that punk. Oh, right.

299
00:17:47,820 --> 00:17:53,480
So tell me, Farrow, which of your friends
would make the best mind slave? Teya?

300
00:17:53,780 --> 00:17:54,700
Joey, perhaps?

301
00:17:55,200 --> 00:17:57,360
You leave them alone. Understand?

302
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:58,640
I'm warning you.

303
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:03,360
Well, it appears I've hit your
sensitive spot, haven't I, Farrow?

304
00:18:03,820 --> 00:18:08,337
Perhaps I can use your friends to get
what I want from you, namely your puzzle.

305
00:18:08,420 --> 00:18:12,540
And the Egyptian God card
you've won I told you,

306
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:15,562
leave my friends out of
this Or else you'll what?

307
00:18:15,980 --> 00:18:18,509
Your friends are
meaningless to me Besides,

308
00:18:18,780 --> 00:18:21,980
I have nothing to lose And
the whole world to gain

309
00:18:23,260 --> 00:18:28,157
Do not test me If any harm befalls
my friends, you will regret it,

310
00:18:28,240 --> 00:18:32,064
Merrick They did nothing to you,
so you settle your score with me

311
00:18:34,460 --> 00:18:37,497
Just as my dragon's one
weakness destroyed it

312
00:18:37,580 --> 00:18:40,560
Your loyalty to our friends
will soon destroy you.

313
00:18:42,620 --> 00:18:43,560
Marek, no!

314
00:18:43,900 --> 00:18:45,420
I must save them.

315
00:18:46,580 --> 00:18:48,700
Hey, get back here right now.

316
00:18:51,080 --> 00:18:53,300
Our duel will have to wait, Kaiba.

317
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:56,260
My friends are in great danger,

318
00:18:56,460 --> 00:19:00,519
and their safety is more important
to me than anything in this world.

319
00:19:02,180 --> 00:19:03,140
Good luck.

320
00:19:03,300 --> 00:19:06,712
Running away from a challenge
is against tournament rules.

321
00:19:11,920 --> 00:19:16,797
finally i have arrived i may have
lost one of my two egyptian god

322
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:20,817
cards to yavi but no matter with
the power of the millennium rod

323
00:19:20,900 --> 00:19:25,177
in my hand and his precious
friends at my disposal i'll get

324
00:19:25,260 --> 00:19:30,357
everything i desire i gotta find my

325
00:19:30,440 --> 00:19:32,499
friends before merrick gets to them

326
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:42,357
this time the pharaoh's
in a battle he can't

327
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:45,597
win soon the egyptian
god card he took from me

328
00:19:45,680 --> 00:19:49,117
and his millennium puzzle
will be mine then i'll

329
00:19:49,200 --> 00:19:52,440
be pharaoh and the world
will cower at my feet

330
00:20:22,620 --> 00:20:24,326
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
